# No environment variables (product-wide)

`pim-app-config` exists so **every** operator-facing setting, secret, dev
gate, and test parameter resolves through **platform storage** (Windows
HKLM + Secrets / Credential Manager; Linux/macOS `/etc` + keyring) or
through **explicit CLI flags and fixture paths** — never through process
environment variables.

## The rule

> **Do not read, write, or document `std::env::var`, `$env:…`,
> `export …`, or runtime `process.env` for product configuration,
> authentication, IPC path overrides, dev safety gates, or Playwright /
> PowerShell test filters.** Agents must not instruct operators to set
> environment variables. Tests must not call `std::env::set_var`.**

Allowed exceptions (narrow):

1. **Compile-time only** — `env!("CARGO_PKG_VERSION")`, `option_env!` in
   `build.rs`, and `CARGO_FEATURE_*` detected in `build.rs` for Cargo
   features (not operator-controlled at runtime).
2. **OS identity APIs** — resolve hostname, ProgramData, and username through
   platform APIs (`SHGetKnownFolderPath`, `gethostname`, `GetUserNameW`),
   not `COMPUTERNAME` / `PROGRAMDATA` / `USERNAME` env vars.
3. **Vite build-time** `import.meta.env` for bundler modes only (not runtime
   admin tokens or API URLs).

Forbidden:

- `$env:OFFLINE_*`, `$env:E2E_*`, `$env:PIM_*`, `$env:AUTO_BUILD_UI`,
  `OFFLINE_DEV_FIXTURES=true`, `DATABASE_URL=…` for live tests.
- `env_compat::resolve_with_env_warning` and any legacy env fallback for
  manifest keys.
- `pim-app-config` **`dev-fallback`** / `.env` file reads in shipping
  binaries (use `--config-dir` for local dev sandboxes).
- IPC path overrides via `PIM_OFFLINE_IPC_*` env vars — use default pipe
  paths in production; tests use `*_at(path)` explicit bind APIs.

## Required patterns

| Need | Use |
| ---- | --- |
| Any manifest key | `AppConfig::resolve` / configurator `get` / `set` |
| Admin token (scripts) | `Get-PimOfflineAdminToken` / configurator `get OFFLINE_ADMIN_TOKEN --reveal` |
| `seed-dev` safety gate | `--confirm` **and** `--dev-fixtures` CLI flags |
| Skip UI npm during `cargo build` | `cargo build --features skip-ui-build` |
| Live DB integration tests | `app_config::try_init()` + `app_config::database_url()` |
| Playwright lab host / token | `ui/e2e/constants.ts` (committed constants) |
| Per-test config / pipes | `tempfile::TempDir` + `*_at(&path)` fixture APIs (R1) |

